<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus extends tender closing date for barley.</title>
<headline>Cyprus extends tender closing date for barley.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission on Friday extended the tender closing date for the supply of 25,000 tonnes of barley to April 18 from April 15, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The barley shipment date is scheduled before May 20, 1997.</p>
</text>
